MITRE ATT&CK(R)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

File:    app/backend/app/data/attack_techniques.json
Content: the IDs and names of the MITRE ATT&CK Enterprise techniques and
         sub-techniques (revoked and deprecated entries left out)
Source:  MITRE ATT&CK Enterprise, version 20.1, STIX data from
         https://github.com/mitre/cti (enterprise-attack/enterprise-attack.json,
         tag "ATT&CK-v20.1"), retrieved on 2026-11-25
Changes: reduced to technique ID and name by scripts/gen_attack_techniques.py;
         the names themselves are unchanged. In the product a sub-technique is
         shown as "<technique name>: <sub-technique name>".

